## 🔍 Project Structure & Orientation

### Read FIRST, Before Any Task

**Location**: `/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`

This file is the single navigation map for the repository:
- Overview of all folders and their purposes
- Quick navigation guide ("I need to…")
- Clear boundaries (what goes where)
- Project stats (bots, endpoints, roles)

**Action**: Read `PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md` first to orient yourself and identify which folder(s) you need to work in. Then read the actual source files in that folder before changing them — never assume their contents.

